{"t":"FDX","made":"2026-11-22 00:18","name":"FedEx Corporation","ko":null,"sector":"Industrials","industry":"Integrated Freight & Logistics","employees":300000,"hq":"Memphis, TN, United States","website":"https://www.fedex.com","summary_en":"FedEx Corporation, together with its subsidiaries, provides transportation, e-commerce, and business services in the United States and internationally. The company operates through two segments, Express U.S. Domestic and Express International. It provides e-commerce and digital solutions; dataworks; printing and shipping management, including digital printing, professional finishing, document creation, design solutions, direct mail, signs and graphics, custom-branded boxes, copying, computer rental, Wi-Fi, corporate print solutions, shredding, U.S. passport processing and renewal, and digital notarization; packing services, as well as packing supplies and boxes; document and business services; and retail access for package transportation. In addition, the company offers logistics services, air and ocean cargo transportation, specialty transportation, customs brokerage, trade management tools and data, and door-to-door solutions; and third party logistics and supply chain management solutions, such as inbound logistics, warehousing and distribution, fulfillment, contract packaging and product configuration, systems integration, returns process and disposition, test, repair, refurbishment, and product liquidation. Further, it provides sales, marketing, administrative, information technology, and back-office support services. FedEx Corporation was founded in 1971 and is headquartered in Memphis, Tennessee.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"FedEx Corporation은 자회사와 함께 미국 및 국제적으로 운송, 전자 상거래 및 비즈니스 서비스를 제공합니다. 이 회사는 Express U.S. Domestic 및 Express International이라는 두 가지 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 전자상거래 및 디지털 솔루션을 제공합니다. 데이터웍스; 디지털 인쇄, 전문 마무리, 문서 작성, 디자인 솔루션, 다이렉트 메일, 간판 및 그래픽, 맞춤형 브랜드 상자, 복사, 컴퓨터 대여, Wi-Fi, 기업 인쇄 솔루션, 파쇄, 미국 여권 처리 및 갱신, 디지털 공증을 포함한 인쇄 및 배송 관리 포장 서비스, 포장 용품 및 상자; 문서 및 비즈니스 서비스; 패키지 운송을 위한 소매점 이용이 가능합니다. 또한 회사는 물류 서비스, 항공 및 해상 화물 운송, 특수 운송, 통관 중개, 무역 관리 도구 및 데이터, 방문 솔루션을 제공합니다. 인바운드 물류, 창고 보관 및 유통, 이행, 계약 포장 및 제품 구성, 시스템 통합, 반품 프로세스 및 처리, 테스트, 수리, 개조 및 제품 청산과 같은 제3자 물류 및 공급망 관리 솔루션. 또한 영업, 마케팅, 관리, 정보 기술 및 백오피스 지원 서비스를 제공합니다. FedEx Corporation은 1971년에 설립되었으며 테네시주 멤피스에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":303.99,"mcap":71194263552.0,"pe":16.387602,"fpe":14.520236,"peg":1.9014,"ps":0.75162864,"pb":2.0577962,"ev_ebitda":7.923,"div":1.61,"beta":1.314,"hi52":345.37,"lo52":214.24658},"fin":{"rev":94720000000.0,"rev_g":0.119,"eps_g":-0.689,"gross":0.27318,"op":0.07892,"net":0.0468,"roe":0.14846,"fcf":5656625152.0,"cash":11480999936.0,"debt":34127998976.0,"de":98.727,"eps":18.55,"feps":20.93561},"own":{"short":0.02,"inst":0.82903,"insider":0.06287},"analyst":{"n":26,"mean":356.80768,"median":359.5,"high":479.0,"low":160.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.72414,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":4,"buy":18,"hold":5,"sell":1,"strongSell":1},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":4,"buy":18,"hold":5,"sell":1,"strongSell":1},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":4,"buy":17,"hold":7,"sell":1,"strongSell":0},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":4,"buy":17,"hold":6,"sell":1,"strongSell":1}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-02","Firm":"Citigroup","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":374.0,"priorPriceTarget":373.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-29","Firm":"JP Morgan","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":400.0,"priorPriceTarget":399.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-27","Firm":"B of A Securities","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":359.0,"priorPriceTarget":378.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-07","Firm":"Citigroup","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":373.0,"priorPriceTarget":3